      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sanaamajeega Mika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwanda siida ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Efraimu, nea gheawungaaschi geeguura Mika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha ghaamwat, “Lapiyeeni was sagalama ea bughala sijagwadiin, ak girukuneani gideaba nimoashti siida geanda, ng'ula geandeawi aniini, siida geanda aniini gil.” Ak gwayeesha ghaamwat, “Ea orjeedeanyu, gagasa gagoonyi NG'UTAMIIDA ghawooda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goodeelsa ghaamwat lapiyeeda was sagalama ea bughala. Ak gwayi ghaamwat, “Aniini gaydasach lapiyeeda ghoah gea NG'UTAMIIDA, ghang'amwa geatingeasu ghoah gea baleanda, ak geesina aseeta sideas ea dea sisna gharinga, ak ghamneawa gaydeadeelneeyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata nea goodeelsa ghaamwat lapiya, gageanu ghaamwat lapiyaji bughalaji iyeenya, ak ghoadaw siida geariir sina lapiya, hean gwasin sanaamooda sideas ea sanaamooda gharinga, mida jeeda gheeh Mika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siisi was Mikahiin gwandeawa gheeda aseecheeka, ak gwasin sanaamu ak ghaghwal orjeanagi aba jeeda orjoagaaschi ghoah ashoohoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba eawoojigiga ea manda sugoocheanda ahaaghwa fuga Israeli, gaba siisi sin gida daah ea doabiiwaat aba madeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gwanda siisi was gheareemaneeda leabu Betlehemeeda Yuda, was siida gheeh Yuda, was siida eemeeda Lawi, ak goobiida hoowa nea rabascheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eada siidida mujiineedida bea Betlehemeeda Yudahiin, ak gawa goobiida heeda bwariiy niny aba rabascheanduumeeda, ak ghwahita ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Efraimu, aba jeeda bareanyeakaaschi, bwak ea ghwahita gheeh Mika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobearsa Mika, “Gileabu yeenu ang'iing'i?” Hean gwayeesha, “Aniini geawooschi siida eemeeda Lawi bea Betlehemeeda Yuda, nea geandi naweeda geang'weeriidi heeda jea dabwariiy ak ghaamwanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Mika, “Apteada aba hiji, abiidana hiji wasa siida ghuuteanyu, ea ashoohoocheanda, ak gaydagoonyi lapiya gilakweayi, ea hang'weaka jea akweala, ea hamita. Hean ghamwas siida Lawi gawa gheeh Mika.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean siida Lawi gahoosasa mideayeedeaba siidida; ak gheareemaneedida ghwanung' gawuurji orjoagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoamwaar Mika siida Lawi, was gheareemaneeda, ak ghoah ashoohoocheandaanyi, ak goobiida gheeh Mika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Mika, “Biisa naanali gideaba gaygwasinneani NG'UTAMIIDA alooheeda, aba gideaba geandeawi siida Lawi was ashoohoocheandeanyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
